n\n🛒  Shop\nLarrys shop but inside the menu dropdown for choosing items, Slider for the amount of the selected item and a button for buying the item!\n\n\n\n🔨Crafting\nSlider for amount of lassos\nManually craft lassos\nAutocraft lassos & settnings for it.\n\n}\n\nTab 2 Modifications {\n\n⛔Player walkspeed\nChanges the players walkspeed\n\n⛔ Player Height\nChanges the players height\n\n⛔Horse Height\nChanges the horse's height\n\n⛔Horse Walkspeed\nChanges the horse's walkspeed\n\n⛔ Horse noclip\nYou can walk trough buildings&alot of stuff\n\n}\n\nTab 2 Misc {\n\n⚙️Force Reset\nNo cooldown reset\n\n\n\n⚙️ Switch Server\nSwitches server.\n\n\n\n⚙️ Kick if staff is on the server\nChecks existing & joining players user-ids and if it's a staff's user-id, then the script kicks you.\n\n\n\n⚙️ Anti Afk\nDisables AFK so you won't get kicked for inactivity.\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n built-in features \"Always Active\"\n\n⚡ Anti-void\nYou won't fall into the void.","tags":["Wild Horse Islands","WHI","Autofarm","paid"],"script":"discord.gg/tsbhub <- you buy it here.\nShow case : https://www.youtube.com/@TSBHUB","owner":{"_id":"66edf9002a8821adb45765b2","username":"tsbhubdevs","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/66edf9002a8821adb45765b2-1726871938399.png","status":"offline","id":"66edf9002a8821adb45765b2","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":32225,"scriptType":"paid","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2024-09-28T00:09:19.551Z","dislikeCount":3,"likeCount":2,"image":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/ae330d8d14720ddb13763e00ffe05cae/500/280/Image/Jpeg","executes":42,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e6b360710ec3c523e9","editBy":{"_id":"66edf9002a8821adb45765b2","username":"tsbhubdevs","status":"offline","id":"66edf9002a8821adb45765b2"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T22:23:18.153Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"68ff8094c40f7ea91f51dfe6","commentBy":{"_id":"68ff7fdecfece2fbcbbb38f8","username":"darlaa","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":"/images/photo/68ff7fdecfece2fbcbbb38f8-1761575090558.png","createdAt":"2025-10-27T14:21:18.812Z","lastActive":"2026-05-27T08:48:34.686Z","status":"offline","id":"68ff7fdecfece2fbcbbb38f8"},"text":"the discord link to purchase the cheats has expired. i would happily pay for this, so please could we have a refreshed link? thanks!","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-10-27T14:24:20.100Z","liked":false,"disliked":false}]},{"slug":"Wild-Horse-Islands-WHI-Krampus-Hub-7512","_id":"64f0d1b1aca66725dcdd69ac","title":"WHI Krampus Hub","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7856b","gameId":6989310863,"name":"Wild Horse Islands","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-ef9a256109a3844d3bff9264fc01f6c0-8c640674334b.png","placeId":6989310863},"features":"Wild Horse Islands - Features\n\n🛡️Farm Helper: disables going afk and optimizes gui closure for better autofarm performance.\n\n🐴 Horse Autofarm Section {\n\n🐴 Auto Equip Lasso: automatically equip the lasso if you do not have it equipped already\n\n🐴 Horse Autofarm Auto Click (J=ON,K=OFF): automatically clicks to collect the horse when farming, clicking J turns on and K turns off\n\n🐴 AutoFarm Horses (Any Island): automatically teleports to the horses on any island to make farming faster\n\n🐴 AutoFarm Horses (Select Island): automatically teleports to the horses on the island you select\n}\n\n💎Ore AutoFarm Section {\n\n💎Auto Equip Harvester: automatically equip the harvester if you do not have it equipped already\n\n💎Ore AutoFarm AutoClick: automatically clicks multiple places on your screen to select and start mining the ore\n\n💎Disable rock collisions: disables colliding with rocks to make ore autofarms much smoother\n\n💎AutoFarm Prismatic Gem: automatically teleports and starts farming prismatic gems on volcano island\n\n💎AutoFarm AnyGem: automatically teleports and starts farming any unspecific gem in the game\n\n💎AutoFarm Test Island Ores: automatically teleports and starts farming all gems on the test island.\n\n🪨AutoFarm Rocks: automatically teleports and starts farming any rocks in the game\n\n💎AutoFarm Specific Gem: automatically starts farming a specifically chosen gem inside of the game\n}\n\n🫒Collectable AutoFarm Section {\nAuto Collect : automatically collects the collectable teleported to\n\n🫒AutoFarm Collectables: automatically teleports to any collectable and collects it\n}\n\n🧾Receipt AutoFarm {\nAutoFarm Receipts 1: supports most courses listed inside of the barn on training island\n\n🧾AutoFarm Receipts 2: supports other courses listed inside of the barn on training island\n}\n\n🛡️Item Mods {\n\n🛡️Reduce Lasso Cooldown: reduces your lasso throw time to basically 0\n\n🛡️Expand Capture Radius: expands the radius of which you can throw your lasso\n\n🛡️Disable Crafting Level Requirement: allows you to craft any lasso at any level\n}\n\n🧐ESP/Chams {\n\n🧐Horse Esp: allows you to see the names of horses and where they are located\n\n🧐Collectable Esp: allows you to see the names of certain collectables and where they are located\n\n🧐Gem/Ore Esp: allows you to see any gem or rock and where they are located if they are loaded into the game\n}\n\n🙋‍♂️Character {\n\n🙋‍♂️Speed Spoof: allows you to modify the walkspeed of your player\n\n🙋‍♂️Velocity Fly: allows you to start flying at high speeds\n}\n\n📜Misc {\n\n📜Horse Notifier: automatically sends you a notification if a rare horse exists\n\n📜Delete Barriers: deletes all barriers that restrict you from flying across any island.\n}","tags":["Wild Horse Islands"],"script":"Find the script in my discord here\nhttps://discord.gg/ZjnMetfUDN\n","owner":{"_id":"64f0d0773cc5a019896e2924","username":"HvHooka88","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/64f0d0773cc5a019896e2924-1693504142478.jpg","status":"offline","id":"64f0d0773cc5a019896e2924","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script",